      "writtenOn": "2019-01-07T17:38:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e PS8625 will read EEPROM during system power on\n\nCan you elaborate it? Exactly what causes PS8625 to read EEPROM? S3-\u003eS0 transition or it\u0027s triggered by software? I understand the main scenario. I\u0027m just trying to think of corner cases.",
